## 关键引用（Karpathy 原话）

> "The LM incrementally builds and maintains a persistent wiki — structured interlinked markdown files — sitting between you and your raw sources."

> "Humans abandon wikis because the maintenance burden grows faster than the value. LLMs don't get bored. They can touch 15 files in a single pass. The cost of maintenance drops to near zero."

